# EXP-009 — significance test: real timing vs Webster vs LSTDQ (SIG 7065)

**Network: 7065osm** (`intersections/7065osm/network/7065osm.net.xml`). The twin discharge rate used in the capacity check (1,920 veh/h/lane) was measured on the hand-built twin, not on this network.


Generated by `matrix.py report`. Test = 10 weekdays (2026-09-17 – 2026-10-02) × 10 replications (new arrival draw + SUMO seed each; identical across controllers). Total delay s/veh (timeLoss + departDelay, by intended departure). Wilcoxon signed-rank, paired, two-sided, Holm-adjusted over the 3 comparisons, α = 0.05.

